  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Camera hardening: MrzImage factories accept the rotation cameras report for sensor oriented buffers; blank frames no longer trigger a wasted tilt retry; the tilt rescue works on the capped working image instead of rotating full resolution photos, and rescued reads report regions in original image coordinates; the glare hint now requires hard clipping so white paper does not trip it; CaptureHints is defensively copied.",
